    "file_name": "AFP_ENG_19970402.0422.tml",
    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970402.0422\n\nWASHINGTON, April 2 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nUS Navy petty officer accused of rape in Japan\n\n\n\n\nA US Navy petty officer has been taken into custody by US military authorities in Japan after a local Japanese woman charged he raped and assaulted her, US television reported Wednesday.\n\nFox News said the woman allegedly was assaulted at the enlisted quarters for US navy personnel in Yokosuka, Japan.\n\nThe victim was taken to an army hospital where she was treated for a broken collarbone, cuts and abrasions, the report said, citing US military officials.",
